  "contract": "Uses the live Ascension realm rates captured in PR #4128 (Rate.XP.Global 0.9295, Rate.XP.Kill 1.0909091, Rate.XP.Elite 1.44) with no source-config override of those keys. A level-20 player killing a level-20 creature in Elwynn Forest (level 1-60 content) has a base gain of ((20*5+45)*20/10+1)/2 = 145. The kill award truncates 145 * rank multiplier * 1.0909091, then Rate.XP.Global truncates again: normal 145 -> 158 -> 146, elite 145*1.44 -> 227 -> 210. Both creatures have no per-creature experience modifier. Stock AzerothCore awarded 145 and 290. Quest 163 Raven Hill (level 20, reward difficulty 2) rewards QuestXP.dbc level 20 column 2 = 390 for a level-20 player; Rate.XP.Quest 1.26 truncates 491.4 to 491 and Rate.XP.Global gives 456. Stock AzerothCore awarded 390.",
